# Testing, evidence and review

Read `docs/quality/DEFINITION_OF_DONE.md`, `docs/quality/QUALITY_GATE_MATRIX.md` and `docs/evidence/EVIDENCE_RETURN_PROTOCOL.md`.

- Run the tests appropriate to the changed behavior, including mandatory negative cases.
- Capture exact commands and exit codes, base/result SHA, worktree before/after and diff.
- Distinguish static validation, unit, integration, database, E2E, security, accessibility and runtime evidence.
- Static validators cannot prove runtime behavior, tenant isolation or deployment readiness.
- Redact secrets and personal data.
- Perform independent review for scope, architecture, contracts, security/privacy, database/RLS and UX as applicable.
- Issue only an allowed gate value and do not inflate status.